relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell></object><mxCell id="A-v85" value="&lt;b&gt;MODE:&lt;/b&gt; grid-parallel only. No isolation device and no backed-up panel; the BESS stops on grid loss. Source breakers sit at the bus end opposite the main (120 percent method layout)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;spacing=0;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="A-L4"><mxGeometry x="30" y="700" width="420" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="A-v86" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="A-L0"><mxGeometry x="10" y="10" width="1200" height="990" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="A-v87" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="A-L0"><mxGeometry x="930" y="890" width="280" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="A-v88" value="&lt;b&gt;{{PROJECT_NAME}}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;{{SITE_ADDRESS}}&lt;br&gt;SLD-A: Grid-tied AC-coupled PV + BESS&lt;br&gt;Sheet {{SHEET}} &amp;nbsp; Rev {{REV}} &amp;nbsp; {{DATE}}&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PRELIMINARY: NOT FOR CONSTRUCTION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Seal area intentionally blank" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;spacing=0;fontSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="A-L4"><mxGeometry x="938" y="896" width="265" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="A-v89" value="&lt;b&gt;SLD-A: Grid-tied AC-coupled PV + BESS&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp; (NTS) &amp;nbsp; Operating mode: grid-parallel" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;spacing=0;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="A-L4"><mxGeometry x="30" y="20" width="900" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="A-v90" value="&lt;b&gt;KEYED NOTES&lt;/b&gt; (templates; resolve placeholders and cite the clause of the selected edition)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt; [N-SERVICE] Field verify {voltage_basis_configuration_phases_wires_grounding} and {service_bus_main_ratings} before equipment selection.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt; [N-OCP] Coordinate {protective_device_and_settings} with {calculated_available_fault_current}, {equipment_sccr_aic} and {conductor_protection_basis}.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt; [N-CONDUCTOR] Provide {conductor_material_size_insulation_quantity_neutral_egc}, {termination_temperature_basis} and {ampacity_calculation_reference}.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.&lt;/b&gt; [N-ESS-LISTING] Identify the listing/certification scope for {exact_ess_combination}; install to {manual_revision}.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5.&lt;/b&gt; [N-ISOLATION] Show {source_isolation_and_transfer_devices}, {control_power_and_failure_response} and {permitted_parallel_operation_basis}.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6.&lt;/b&gt; [N-PCS-SETTING] Power control system {listed_pcs_function} limits {controlled_quantity} to {setting_value}; settings access restricted per {manual_revision}.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7.&lt;/b&gt; [N-UTILITY] Comply with {actual_utility_tariff_and_approved_interconnection}, including {required_settings_and_witness_tests}.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8.&lt;/b&gt; [N-T24] Document {building_scope_and_compliance_path}, {current_rule_and_errata}, and {calculation_and_form_references}.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;9.&lt;/b&gt; [N-GROUND] Identify {grounding_electrode_egc_gec_and_bonding_details}, including {neutral_switching_and_derived_system_basis}." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;spacing=0;fontSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="A-L4"><mxGeometry x="30" y="845" width="890" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="A-v91" value="LINES: power solid &amp;nbsp; sense dashed 4-4 &amp;nbsp; control dashed 8-4 (arrow = command) &amp;nbsp; grounding dash-dot" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;spacing=0;fontSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="A-L4"><mxGeometry x="30" y="815" width="700" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="B" name="B Backup hybrid PCS + CLP"><mxGraphModel 